wn the Invader, army troops were scattered all over the planet.<br>Kotcha-weha  for Simultaneous Combat Over the cloud<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2149270/extras/3da39c51cb1cc88713f19b9b7dd92cb3.poster.avif?t=1668442775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2149270/extras/3da39c51cb1cc88713f19b9b7dd92cb3.webm?t=1668442775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2149270/extras/3da39c51cb1cc88713f19b9b7dd92cb3.mp4?t=1668442775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Phyakh for Simultaneous Combat On Ground continue to Underwater Fight<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2149270/extras/a4db2b0835c5a349fa7c19dc3ab0068e.poster.avif?t=1668442775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2149270/extras/a4db2b0835c5a349fa7c19dc3ab0068e.webm?t=1668442775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2149270/extras/a4db2b0835c5a349fa7c19dc3ab0068e.mp4?t=1668442775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Sriha for Explore over the SuperNatural Environment<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2149270/extras/008c7d4e5c9591995cf43afc7043a54a.poster.avif?t=1668442775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2149270/extras/008c7d4e5c9591995cf43afc7043a54a.webm?t=1668442775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2149270/extras/008c7d4e5c9591995cf43afc7043a54a.mp4?t=